  "text": "## Template 7: Complaint Acknowledgment  \n**Subject:** We've Received Your Complaint — Reference [EXC-XXXXX]  \n```\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nThank you for bringing this matter to our attention. We take your\ncomplaint seriously and are committed to resolving it.\n\nYour Complaint Reference: [EXC-XXXXX]\nDate Received: [date and time]\nAssigned To: [Investigator Name]\n\nWhat Happens Next:\n1. We will investigate your complaint thoroughly\n2. We'll contact you if we need additional information\n3. We will respond with our findings within 8 calendar days\n4. You'll receive a full explanation and any resolution\n\nYour Rights:\nIf you're unhappy with our response, you have the right to escalate\nto the Financial Ombudsman Service:\n- Phone: 0800 023 4567\n- Website: www.financialombudsman.org.uk\n- They're free and independent\n\nContact Us:\nIf you have any questions while we investigate:\n- Phone: 0800-555-2265\n- Email: support@firstuk.bank (reference your complaint ID)\n\nWe appreciate your patience as we work to make this right.\n\nBest regards,\nFirstUK Bank Complaints Team\n```  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 9/15",
  "domain": "banking_communications",
